- Overall: [Incomplete/Ready/Provisionally strong]

=== ALLOY_MODEL_IMPROVEMENTS ===
[Specific fixes and constraints]

=== ASSUMPTIONS REVIEW ===
[Items to reduce/keep/confirm or `N/A` if syntax error presents]

